{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22029","headline":"和荅诗十首 和分水岭 · 白居易","name":"和荅诗十首 和分水岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高岭峻棱棱，细泉流亹亹。\n势分合不得，东西随所委。\n悠悠草蔓底，溅溅石罅里。\n分流来几年，昼夜两如此。\n朝宗远不及，去海三千里。\n浸润小无功，山苗长旱死。\n萦纡用无所，奔迫流不已。\n唯作呜咽声，夜入行人耳。\n有源殊不竭，无坎终难止。\n同出而异流，君看何所似。\n有似骨肉亲，派别从兹始。\n又似势利交，波澜相背起。\n所以赠君诗，将君何所比。\n不比山上泉，比君井中水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}